Signing excises the whole infomdat element from the authenticated message.

The frame walker left only the infomdate flag bit out of the tag and declined
frames that set it. It now leaves out the whole element (flag and body), as DEE
does, and signs and verifies those frames. Frames without the element hash as
before. Includes tests and docs/library/signing.md updates.

---

